WEBVTT

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:09.550
Sho good!

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.990
It tastes even more delicious than usual!

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:18.990
Life has a way of doing that! When it treats you well, everything seems that much sharper to the taste buds.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:22.660
And it really has treated us well as of late!

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:28.540
HeartCatch Precure: Super Silhouettes!

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:34.490
Now that the four of them have united their hearts and powers as one,

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:37.430
we've unlocked a new power to call upon!

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.600
They're all sho cool!

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:42.560
And we've gathered a ton of Heart Seeds too!

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:46.350
The Great Heart Tree's starting to look really vibrant again!

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.010
All thanks to our Precure!

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.700
I wonder what I can do to thank Tsubomi, though.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:58.280
Oh! I wanna thank Ichuki for what she's done too!

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:00.220
Give thanks?

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:04.170
HeartCatch

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.620
Precure!

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:09.170
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:12.170
Now, all together

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:14.680
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:17.680
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:25.270
Within each of our chests,

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:27.940
they begin to sprout

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:29.610
The seeds of the heart

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:30.860
are growing

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.480
bit by bit

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:34.150
Red,

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:34.770
white

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:36.070
and yellow

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.820
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:40.280
all varied colors

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:41.760
that they

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:43.910
shine so brightly!

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:49.250
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.750
with such care

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.470
will never wither

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:58.050
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.930
Now, all together

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:03.390
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.060
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:10.980
They're always right by our sides

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:11.810
So together

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:15.650
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:18.610
bloom even more!

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:20.110
HeartCatch

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:21.620
Precure!

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:33.540
I wonder what'd be a nice surprise for Erika...

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:40.510
I really need your help!

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:42.180
Wh-What's wrong?!

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:43.600
I've gotta transform!

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:45.010
On it!

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:57.870
Go, Seed of the Precure!

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.320
Precure!

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.120
Open My Heart!

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.870
Have the Desert Apostles invaded your house?!

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:13.100
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:17.570
Cure Marine!

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:23.660
Marine! Where's the Desert Apostle?!

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:25.530
Desert Apostle?

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:26.310
What?

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:27.640
Huh?!

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:39.360
Gather, Floral Power!

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:42.780
Marine Tact!

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:43.980
Now wait just one second!

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:44.450
Huh?

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:47.790
Are you telling me there is no Desert Apostle?!

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.950
Then what'd you transform for?!

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:54.620
Well, our Tacts have the power to purify Desertrians, right?

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:59.790
So I figure they'd be able to clean my room for me too!

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.170
Clean your room?!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:10.930
Erika's in Trouble<i>!</i>

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:10.930
Erika's in Trouble<i>!</i>

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:15.940
Well, you know, I've been feeling oddly productive lately...

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:20.420
But Mom says if I don't clean up 
afterward, I can't have any snacks!

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.610
And that's a fate worse than death!

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:26.370
So here goes!

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:31.080
Flowers, glitter bright!

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:40.330
You can't just go using your Tact for chores like that!

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:43.050
Don't be so stingy, jeez!

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:49.180
It's not just a magic wand to solve all your problems with! It exists to save people from the depths of—

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.390
Whaaat?!

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.600
Aww, come on. It's not that big a deal.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.980
It's not a massager either, you know!

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:57.940
Oh, that a fact?

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:05.360
All that floral power's doing wonders for my fur...

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.070
Wait, no!

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:08.530
Floral power doesn't do that!

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:11.150
Anyway, you can tidy your room yourself!

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:16.750
You can do it for me, right, Coffret?

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.970
You can clean up your own mess, Erika!

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:20.420
I don't see why I should do it!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.850
Well, we're partners, right?

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:26.310
I'll leave it to you, 'kay?

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:36.480
Erika!

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:42.230
You can't just leave your Tact lying around like that!

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.690
I've... I've...

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:48.230
I've had it up to here with this!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:53.160
I put up with a lot from you, 
Erika, but this is the last straw!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:58.620
My heart may be vaster than the sea, but this is as much as it can take!

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:04.710
This is goodbye!

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:07.580
Chypre! I need someone to talk to right now!

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:08.400
Chyp—

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:14.290
We're out here, Coffret!

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:17.890
What're you doing?

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.200
Tsubomi and I are planting these bulbs!

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:24.780
I'm glad Chypre's helping out.
 It's making light work of it, really.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.330
Thank you so much.

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:28.440
No need to thank me!

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:33.000
Courtesy costs nothing, as they say!

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:35.120
You deserve whatever thanks I can give you.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:39.830
Well then, thank you for always 
being there to help me, Tsubomi!

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:52.260
I bet even if I did clean her room for her, Erika wouldn't bother to thank me!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.470
No way am I gonna help her!

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:56.780
Coffret?

00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:57.640
Huh?

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:00.420
Hey there.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.060
Hrm?

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:03.520
Isn't Erika with you?

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:06.820
I-I'm just out for a float on my own, that's all!

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.570
Are you going somewhere, Itsuki?

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:12.510
Yeah, I'm participating in a martial arts tournament.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.700
And I'm gonna cheer her on every shtep of the way!

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:22.120
Hooray! Hooray! I-chu-ki!

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.840
Show 'em whose bosh, Ichuki!

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.600
You're all the support I could ever need, Potpourri!

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:40.100
I'll be shure to cheer you on all the way!

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:43.990
Just make sure that nobody else sees you, okay?

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:45.390
Shure thing!

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:46.640
Hey, Coffret, why don't you...

00:07:46.640 --> 00:07:47.440
Huh?

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:51.940
Coffret?

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:58.760
Itsuki manages to juggle everything in her life just fine,

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.890
but Erika can't even find time to clean her room!

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:03.460
She's an idle, lazy, slacking layabout!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:22.720
Who's there?

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:29.780
Sorry. It's just me.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.570
You're all dirty. Look.

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:37.250
Alone, I take it?

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.190
Yeah...

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:41.560
There we go. All clean again.

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:42.930
Thank you!

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:44.540
You're very welcome!

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:49.200
Why were you staring at the Heart Pot like that, Yuri?

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:54.240
I suppose I rather consider it a 
memento of my time with Cologne.

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:56.470
Sometimes I get lost in it.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:01.060
You still really care for Cologne, don't you, Yuri?

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:04.140
Of course I do.

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:06.570
Huh?

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:13.940
I'd be fine if Erika was even half as considerate as Yuri is!

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:29.490
Hm?

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:33.880
It wasn't just me, was it?

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.190
I wish Erika took after her friends a bit more.

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:46.830
Maybe then she'd actually care about her partner.

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:52.400
Coffret!

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:54.260
Down here!

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:56.150
Rumi! Haruka!

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:58.460
What're you doing?

00:09:58.460 --> 00:10:00.640
Not telling!

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:01.360
What?

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:05.100
We're staying firmly here at base today, thank you.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:09.200
I <i>am</i> planning, thank you very much!

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.160
Come back some other time.

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:18.250
Oh? You've been training, have you?

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:21.940
And you think that'll make a difference? You've never been competent before!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.220
What am I watching here, exactly?

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:37.820
Ugh, I feel sweaty just watching this!

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.450
Yes, yes, I am watching!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.350
Looks like he got busted.

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:56.170
Must be nice, being able to patch up that easily.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:07.470
You don't seriously think you can beat them, do you?

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:14.750
<i>We have the Desert Devils if we need troops!</i>

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:17.190
<i>You guys can go take a hike!</i>

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.440
Flowers, glitter bright!

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:27.450
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:34.840
You got me...

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:37.190
Hooray, I won!

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.430
I get to be Blossom now, right?

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:44.680
Rumi! Haruka!

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:48.450
Don't go swinging the Tact around too hard, okay?

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:56.100
Thanks, Coffret!

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:59.130
I mean, this is really important to the Precure, isn't it?

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:01.510
It's so cool we got to play with the real thing!

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:09.410
At least you two understand 
how important the Tacts are!

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:40.690
Snackies!

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.620
What are you doing?!

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:48.490
Rumi, Haruka, you have to get out of here!

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.460
R-Right.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:50.730
You come too, Coffret!

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:52.830
No! I have to get the Tact back!

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:54.920
Snacky!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:59.200
Give me back that Tact!

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.960
This belongs to the Precure, not you!

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:06.430
Get back!

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.380
Coffret...

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:13.430
Rumi! Haruka!

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:53.970
Let's do this, Coffret!

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:57.230
Come on, Coffret! We haven't got all day!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:59.100
O-On it!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.320
Rumi, Haruka! Promise me you won't look!

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:03.570
Okay!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.410
Go, Seed of the Precure!

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.000
Precure!

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.790
Open My Heart!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.880
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.470
Cure Marine!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:32.700
Just Snackies to worry about, huh?

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.660
I think I can take these guys, no sweat!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:41.920
I was so looking forward to my day off, and then you just had to go run off somewhere, Coffret.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.130
Well excuse me!

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.590
I don't remember asking you to come look for me, though!

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:49.760
Oh, that's nice! Maybe I won't bother saving you next time!

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.390
I don't think you even care about me, Marine!

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:57.140
Where's this coming from?

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:59.020
I want an answer!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.810
Do you care about me or not?!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:05.900
I could ask you the same thing!

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:12.200
If you weren't so selfish, and demanding, and lazy...

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:15.990
Excuse me?! You're making me sound really awful!

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:19.040
Well you've gotta be pretty awful if
 you can't even clean your own room!

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.250
And you're pretty awful if you won't even help me!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:33.220
Coffret.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.720
Fine.

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:38.260
We'll have this conversation after we've dealt with those Snackies!

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:51.490
Marine Shoot!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.790
They don't give up, do they?

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:06.460
Snackies might be weak, but they're tough!

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.540
Maybe you should give them more credit!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:12.760
Fine then!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:14.760
Marine Impact!

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:16.680
Impact!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.390
Impact!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.780
They can tape themselves up?

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.400
You learn something new every day.

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:38.320
Coffret, let's use the Mirage!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:42.580
We can't! The Mirage needs all four of you 
using it to power the HeartCatch Orchestra!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.660
Wait, really?!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.290
Behind you, Marine!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.250
Huh?

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:57.340
Why are they so heavy?!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:59.510
Hey, lemme go, dang it!

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:01.180
What?

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:04.890
Isn't that my Tact?!

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:29.790
Only Precure can use the power of the Tacts, you doof!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.210
Isn't he?

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:33.380
Hmph!

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:36.690
I've had enough of this!

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:42.950
Get back here!

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:46.770
Marine...

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:50.560
Taking hostages now? You coward!

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.150
Help has arrived!

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.030
Nice timing!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:02.990
Gotcha!

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:11.790
Now you've done it...

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.960
How dare you hurt my partner like that?!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.380
I'm gonna make you pay!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:24.140
Nobody hurts my Coffret.

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:29.060
My heart may be vaster than the sea, but this is as much as it can take!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:39.740
Flowers, glitter bright!

00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:47.870
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.980
Thanks for saving us!

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:14.020
You were so cool...

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.480
Blossom!

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:18.650
Don't I get any thanks?!

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:21.950
Maybe if you hadn't fought with Coffret.

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.610
But we don't like people who don't care for their Tacts!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:25.910
Do we?

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:32.580
Coffret?

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:36.250
Erika was really worried about you, you know?

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:40.920
No matter what you think, she really <i>does</i> care about you an awful lot.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:45.180
But I think you know that too, deep down.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:51.730
Erika.

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:56.900
Is there anything you'd like me to do or get for you?

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:00.780
Erika?

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:02.490
Oh, yeah, sure!

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.700
You can clean my room and do my homework!

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.820
And you can get me...

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:07.660
Clothes!

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:08.660
Accessories!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:09.660
And new shoes!

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.540
I shouldn't've asked.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:14.710
Just kidding!

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:16.790
I think I'd be fine with...

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:20.670
you just being there for me, Coffret.

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:30.350
Brrr, it's cold.

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:32.770
Sheesh.

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:35.600
Maybe you should remember to wear a coat in the future!

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:38.520
You're so warm!

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:41.110
Like a fluffy little hot water bottle!

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:44.110
I suppose they fight so much because they worry about each other.

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:45.320
Maybe so!

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:47.930
Besides, the cold won't bother you, Erika!

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:48.740
Why not?

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:51.240
You're too daft to notice it!

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:52.910
Hey, you!

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:03.460
Well, see, I figured I must've put the Tact <i>somewhere</i>, so I turned the place over a bit...

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:05.630
You'll help me clean it up though, right?

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.980
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.190
Come on, all together now!

00:22:22.990 --> 00:22:25.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:32.660
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:38.250
